The contribution is the hub-reroute construction: its search, the exact builder, the 21 reroutes and the checks in this package. All code here is newly written, and predecessor packages were read as data only.

Clear1nsight supplied the chart-595 helper split (PR #7697) and the role-230 rechart (PR #7682), which is the first hub reroute. Ali Romman supplied the banked-transfer circuit and its fifteen pivots (PR #7674). SYLforge supplied the #7669 word and the signed sixteen-call caller. DreamingOfClouds, Rohan Arun, Jerry Chen (CubeJerry), Douglas Colkitt and the authors credited in the inherited notices supplied predecessor constructions, the selected framework and the repository infrastructure.

The exact predecessor notices are in `credits/`. `source/` holds the K372-2 word, the twelve #7669 edits and the 16-call caller as published with #7669. `ASSETS.json` binds every package file.
